-# Review 001: R0012 (code mode)
-Inputs: HEAD fa63435 against origin/main 1facc0e (`git diff origin/main...HEAD`: Touch, Hud, Controls, Camera, HudView, DangerHud, Main, the two unit specs, the three amended acceptance specs, the issue and raft documents, a ticket-prep lesson note). Ran `scripts/check.sh --full` (GATE PASSED, 1908 passed, 0 failed, 73.9s wall) and `scripts/tracker.sh check R0012` (7/7, which runs f0027 5/5, f0028 3/3, f0029 5/5, `promote-check`, RC1 and RC2). The tree was clean after both runs.
