-- `z-nile/roots.luau` prints the registry's current roots (`lune run z-nile/roots`, one per line) or the format and lint folders (`lune run z-nile/roots -- --luau-dirs`: `src tests scripts z-nile` and then every root not already listed); a registry that does not parse exits 1.
